OL,3,AIsraeli settlers attack West Bank
OL,4,Avillage and block Palestinian family's
OL,5,Areturn home
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 100 Israeli settlers have
OL,8,Fcarried out attacks in a Palestinian
OL,9,Fvillage in the occupied West Bank,
OL,10,Fstopping a family escorted by the
OL,11,FIsraeli military from returning to
OL,12,Ftheir homes, which had been seized
OL,13,Fweeks ago by settlers.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
