OL,3,AIsraeli settlers attack West Bank
OL,4,Avillage and block Palestinian family's
OL,5,Areturn home
OL,6,
OL,7,F"My feeling now is that I am happy to
OL,8,Fhave escaped death. I genuinely
OL,9,Fexpected they were going to kill us."
